WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.311
Meet Sahkarmi.

2
00:00:02.331 --> 00:00:08.568
A free app with a team of AI coworkers that work on your own Windows computer.

3
00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:16.205
When you open it the first time, pick a provider.

4
00:00:16.225 --> 00:00:19.043
The free one needs no login.

5
00:00:19.063 --> 00:00:20.957
Click Continue.

6
00:00:20.977 --> 00:00:22.449
Done.

7
00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.012
This is your team.

8
00:00:27.032 --> 00:00:30.984
Nine coworkers, each with a job: accounts,

9
00:00:31.004 --> 00:00:34.199
sales, support, research and more.

10
00:00:34.219 --> 00:00:40.027
The icons on the left open Knowledge, Approvals, Schedules and Settings.

11
00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:46.655
Give a task like you would to a colleague.

12
00:00:46.675 --> 00:00:53.198
Here we ask Vikram in Sales to write a polite WhatsApp reminder for a late invoice.

13
00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:02.727
Before a coworker touches your computer, it asks you first, in plain words.

14
00:01:02.747 --> 00:01:07.070
Nothing happens until you choose Approve or Reject.

15
00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:14.689
And here is the draft, ready to copy and send.

16
00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:18.128
Knowledge Bases.

17
00:01:18.148 --> 00:01:23.804
Create one, add your own files, like this daily report spreadsheet,

18
00:01:23.824 --> 00:01:26.006
a policy and a price list.

19
00:01:26.026 --> 00:01:28.578
They stay on your PC.

20
00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:37.111
Search in plain words and it finds the right lines, even inside a spreadsheet.

21
00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:44.394
Now ask Asha in Accounts a question about those files.

22
00:01:44.414 --> 00:01:47.188
She reads them and answers.

23
00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:56.179
In Settings, Permissions decides what every coworker may do on its own and what always needs your approval.

24
00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:03.056
Connect Telegram and your team works from your phone too.

25
00:02:03.076 --> 00:02:06.227
The setup steps are built right in.

26
00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:11.069
Voice works offline.

27
00:02:11.089 --> 00:02:15.008
Speak your task; nothing leaves your computer.

28
00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:19.996
Need more hands?

29
00:02:20.016 --> 00:02:23.525
The Marketplace has ready-made coworkers.

30
00:02:23.545 --> 00:02:27.633
One click adds a GST Accountant to your team.

31
00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:33.692
For big jobs, give the whole team one goal and they split the work.

32
00:02:33.712 --> 00:02:38.712
Schedules and Routines run tasks every day, on their own.

33
00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:43.852
Get it free at sahkarmi dot site.

34
00:02:43.872 --> 00:02:51.703
Install from the Microsoft Store in one click, or download the installer for Windows 10 and 11.

35
00:02:51.723 --> 00:02:56.997
If Windows shows a warning, click More info, then Run anyway.

36
00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:02.220
Sahkarmi.

37
00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.460
Your AI team.

38
00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:07.878
Free, private, made in India.
